  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Dissolve ingredients (except bicarbonate, yeast extract, vitamins and sulfide), then sparge medium with 80% N2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture for 30 – 45 min to make it anoxic."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Dispense medium under same gas atmosphere into anoxic Hungate-type tubes or serum vials and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Prior to inoculation add bicarbonate from a sterile anoxic stock solution prepared under 80% N2 and 20% CO2 gas atmosphere and yeast extract, vitamins and sulfide from sterile anoxic stock solutions prepared under 100% N2 gas."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Vitamins are sterilized by filtration. Adjust pH of complete medium to 6.8, if necessary."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": "First dissolve nitrilotriacetic acid and adjust pH to 6.5 with KOH, then add minerals. Adjust final to pH 7.0 with KOH."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
